# ── Non-analysis tooling (scaffolding, not science) ────────────────────────────
# Only analysis and visualization code is version-controlled. Manuscript
# consolidation, one-off patches, environment checks and repo introspection are
# scaffolding: they are ignored at creation, never committed and later removed.
# Named individually rather than globbed, because build_/audit_ prefixes are
# shared with genuine analysis and with the provenance layer that constitutes
# the evidence record.
scripts/_full_rerun.sh
